    "notes": "All 12 views inspected. Carved tracery on the upper doors is real geometry, visible in the raking orbit views, and the four doors are separate objects shown slightly ajar. Back and bottom views confirm the carcass is properly closed with an unfinished ply back, which is correct for an antique. 12.2k tris.",
